==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Possibly from the instrumental interrogative {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*hwī||how, with what}}, with the initial h- replaced by the þ- from the forms of {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*sa}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|is|conjunction}}

# [[because]], [[for]], [[since]]
#* Colossians 3:9
#*: {{usex|Ljúgið ekki hver að öðrum, '''því''' þér hafið afklæðst hinum gamla manni með gjörðum hans.|t=Do not lie to each other, '''since''' you have taken off your old self with its practices.|lang=is}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|af því að}}, {{l|is|því að||because}}
* {{l|is|því aðeins að||only if, on the condition that}}

