{{Icelandic personal pronouns}}

===Adverb===
{{is-adv|head=því...því}}

# [[the]]...[[the]] (when comparing)
#: {{usex|en '''því''' meira sem hann blés, '''því''' þéttara vafði ferðamaðurinn kápunni að sér|t=but '''the''' more he blew, '''the''' tighter the traveller wrapped his coat around himself|lang=is}}

